---
import ContentPage from '../layouts/ContentPage.astro';
---

<ContentPage
  title="Contact Cool Symbols"
  description="Contact Cool Symbols for feedback, bug reports, feature requests, partnerships, or anything else, write to info@cool-symbols.net."
  path="contact">
  <h1>Get in touch</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    We read every email. Whether it's a bug report, a feature idea, a partnership pitch, or just a
    hello - write to us.
  </p>

  <div class="contact-card">
    <div class="contact-card-label">Email</div>
    <a class="email" href="mailto:info@cool-symbols.net">info@cool-symbols.net</a>
    <p class="contact-card-note">Typical reply within 2–3 business days.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>What to write about</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Bug reports.</strong> If something is broken - wrong copy-paste result, AI returning errors,
      layout glitches on a specific device - tell us what you did, what you expected, and what happened.
      Screenshots help.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Feature requests.</strong> Want a specific font style added? A new AI mode? A symbol category
      we're missing? We're a small team but we read everything.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Partnerships.</strong> If you're building something that could plug into the AI tools (a
      bot, an extension, a content site), let's talk.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Press and licensing.</strong> If you'd like to feature the tool somewhere or have licensing
      questions about the (mostly Unicode-based) content.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What we can't help with</h2>
  <p>
    We can't recover lost generations - nothing is stored on our side. We can't unlock more daily AI
    generations on request; if you need higher limits, watch for a future Pro tier announcement. And
    we can't write content for you on demand - the AI tools are self-serve.
  </p>
</ContentPage>
